<h1>Context API → Module Providers</h1>
<p style="color:var(--ui-text-muted);margin-bottom:1rem">No wrapping. No nesting. No provider hell. Expressions access context directly.</p>

<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem">
  <div>
    <h3>React Provider Hell</h3>
    <pre style="background:#1e1e2e;color:#cdd6f4;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.8rem;overflow-x:auto;line-height:1.6"><code>// app.tsx — "Provider Hell"
&lt;ThemeProvider&gt;
  &lt;AuthProvider&gt;
    &lt;QueryClientProvider&gt;
      &lt;RouterProvider&gt;
        &lt;IntlProvider&gt;
          &lt;FeatureFlagProvider&gt;
            &lt;ToastProvider&gt;
              &lt;App /&gt;
            &lt;/ToastProvider&gt;
          &lt;/FeatureFlagProvider&gt;
        &lt;/IntlProvider&gt;
      &lt;/RouterProvider&gt;
    &lt;/QueryClientProvider&gt;
  &lt;/AuthProvider&gt;
&lt;/ThemeProvider&gt;

// Each provider wraps the tree.
// Ordering matters. Nesting depth grows.
// Each requires its own useContext hook.</code></pre>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>PRESTO (Module Context Providers)</h3>
    <pre style="background:#1e1e2e;color:#cdd6f4;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.8rem;overflow-x:auto;line-height:1.6"><code>&lt;!-- Modules register context providers --&gt;
&lt;!-- Values available as expressions: --&gt;

&lt;htx:auth&gt;
  Hello, {htx:auth.user.name}
&lt;/htx:auth&gt;

Request ID: {htx:requestId}

&lt;!-- No wrapping. No nesting.
     No useContext. No provider ordering.
     Modules inject values into the pipeline.
     Templates consume them as expressions. --&gt;</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

<h3 style="margin-top:2rem">Live: Context values from module providers</h3>
<div style="font-family:monospace;background:#f5f5f5;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.8">
  Auth: <htx:auth><strong><htx:v>auth.user.name</htx:v></strong> (role: <htx:v>auth.user.role</htx:v>)</htx:auth><htx:unauth><em>Not authenticated (showing guest view)</em></htx:unauth><br>
  Request ID: <strong>{htx:requestId}</strong><br>
  <em>Both injected by modules. No provider components. No wrapping.</em>
</div>

